      "page_text": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "text_chars": 2,
          "text_preview": "P1",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "text_chars": 784,
          "text_preview": "Some Tips For Teacher 1, This guide is NOT for one class time, you can finish it in many times. 2, This guide is just a topic guide ,it’s not a strictly study guide.You don’t need to ask questions one",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "text_chars": 752,
          "text_preview": "Learning objective 1, Key words: Journey, west, split, powerful, shot, emperor, captain, nearby, southern, magical, sight, interesting 2,   Key   sentences: As time passed, Monkey learned to walk, run",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 4,
          "text_chars": 335,
          "text_preview": "                             Have    you ever seen the Journey to The West before?  Warm up Tips:1,   Look   at the pictures and ask the S if he/she has ever watched the Chinese Journey to The West be",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 5,
          "text_chars": 20,
          "text_preview": "Video Time(0-2:20) P 5",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "text_chars": 259,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, what can you see in the pictures?                  2,what’s the name of the mountain ? 3, what did their magic on the rock ?                  4, Can you guess what will happen to ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 7,
          "text_chars": 209,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What happened to the rock?                  2, Who’s born in the rock? 3,Who are the Monkey’s parents ?             4, where are you born? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 8,
          "text_chars": 249,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What’s the name of the house?                 2, Where is the Cloud Palace? 3, Who live in the Cloud Palace?                   4, Is day or night in Cloud Palace? How do you know?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 9,
          "text_chars": 278,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Do you Know who was sitting on the throne?  2, What’s The Jade Emperor’s job?  3, Where did the light come from?  4, Who was standing next to The Jade Emperor? (The captain)   5, ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 10,
          "text_chars": 309,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1,  Who rushed out of the Hall? Why did he come out? 2,  What magical did the captain have? 3,  Do you know the name of the gate?( The southern gate of the heaven) 4, Who were guardi",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 11,
          "text_chars": 165,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What caused the light? 2, Did The Jade Emperor surprise?     Why? 3, What did the Captain wear? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences.) P1 1",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 12,
          "text_chars": 23,
          "text_preview": "Video Time(2:20-end) P1 2",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 13,
          "text_chars": 147,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What can you see in the pictures?     2, What skills did the Monkey learn? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences.) P1 3",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 14,
          "text_chars": 147,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What can you see in the pictures?     2, What skills did the Monkey learn? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences.) P1 4",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 15,
          "text_chars": 448,
          "text_preview": "Free talk-skills Tips : 1, What skills do   you   have   ?                                 2,Who   taught   you   these   skills? 3, Can you tell me what else you can do?          4,How did you learn ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 16,
          "text_chars": 423,
          "text_preview": "Free talk-skills Tips : 1, What else skills do   you   have   ?    (ride the bike, climb the tree……)        2, Who   taught   you   these   skills? 3, How old were you when you learned these skills? T",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 17,
          "text_chars": 200,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What can you see in the picture? 2, What were they doing?( guide S to speak one by one? 3,Who did the Monkey become friends with? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 18,
          "text_chars": 195,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What were they doing? And where? 2,  Why? (hot) 3, What were they discussing?  4, What did the monkeys and apes want to find? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences.) P",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 19,
          "text_chars": 145,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What were they doing? 2, What did they want to find ?  3, Was it far away? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences.) P1 9",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 20,
          "text_chars": 230,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What were they doing?                                   2, What did they find finally? 3, Have you ever seen a waterfall before?         4, What ‘s waterfall? ( Remember to ask Ss",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 21,
          "text_chars": 209,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What were they discussing?  2, What did the gibbon say?( King) 3, Was anyone brave enough to try? Why? 4, Do you want to jump and try? Why? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 22,
          "text_chars": 282,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Who stepped forward?                                 2, What did the Monkey say? Why? 3, Do you think the Monkey is brave or not? Why? 4, Have you ever tried some dangerous thing?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 23,
          "text_chars": 200,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What happened? 2, What will happen if the Monkey can jump through the waterfall? 3, Can you guess if the Monkey came back safely? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 24,
          "text_chars": 162,
          "text_preview": "Free talk 1,Do you like this story?  Why ？ 2,Which character do you like most? Why? 3,Do you   think the story is real or not? Why? 4,Do   you   know   any   other fairy   tales? P 24",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
